  "note": "A fork of Project Maya that adds DeepSeek V4 and V4.1, Qwen3.8-Flash-Next and Ornith. Each pack is named for the PC it targets, such as 16G64G for a 16 GB GPU with 64 GB of RAM, and memory_gb is that GPU plus the memory limit the author measures such a PC with: 28, 58, 84 and 123 GB for 32, 64, 96 and 128 GB of RAM. The speeds are the author's, on a Ryzen AI Max+ 395 whose RAM is about three times as fast as a usual DDR5 desktop's, so expect less on one. It also loads other GGUFs of these models, packed by hand. Patch releases come several times a day."
